sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student
    participant Reader as Acadrix Reader
    participant CM as CodeMirror buffer
    participant BG as Extension service worker
    participant Bridge as Main-world bridge
    participant Ace as IITM Ace editor

    Student->>Reader: Click Apply Changes
    Reader->>CM: Read workingCode
    Reader->>BG: Request privileged write
    BG->>Bridge: Dispatch verified write
    Bridge->>Ace: Re-read editor and question context
    alt Context or protected range changed
        Bridge-->>BG: Reject with diagnostic
        BG-->>Reader: Show safe failure
    else Snapshot is still valid
        Bridge->>Ace: Replace editable range only
        Bridge->>Ace: Verify protected prefix and suffix
        Ace-->>Bridge: Updated editor state
        Bridge-->>BG: Confirm write
        BG-->>Reader: Show applied state
    end
